  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/pickletweaks?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fpickle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/pickletweaks/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fpickletweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pickle Tweaks 添加了多种实用的原版增强风格功能和调整。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组的所有功能均可在配置文件中单独禁用。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成格工具修复：</strong> 在合成格中使用修复材料修复损坏的工具和武器，就像铁砧一样。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>多功能镐：</strong> 集斧、镐、铲功能于一体的工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>右键收获作物：</strong> 右键点击完全成熟的作物可收获并重新种植。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具信息提示：</strong> 在工具提示中显示工具的挖掘速度和挖掘等级。同时为弓类工具提示添加背包中有效弹药数量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>燧石与绿宝石工具：</strong> 新增燧石和绿宝石材质的工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>镰刀：</strong> 用于范围采集植物类方块的工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>长柄镰：</strong> 用于区域收割和重种植作物的工具，同时可作为范围攻击武器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>HWYLA/Jade 可采集性提示：</strong> 在 HWYLA/Jade 提示中显示方块的采集等级。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>浇水壶：</strong> 提升区域内作物生长速度。提供基础型（3x3）和强化型（7x7）两种变体。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>煤炭与木炭碎片：</strong> 每片可烧炼一个物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>夜视护目镜：</strong> 佩戴时赋予使用者夜视能力。提供基础型和强化型变体。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钻石与绿宝石苹果：</strong> 提供额外增益效果的苹果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>物品磁铁：</strong> 吸引物品和经验球至玩家身边。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>筛网：</strong> 用于从砂砾中合成燧石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具损坏调整：</strong> 新增调整机制，使工具和武器在完全损坏前1次使用时会失效，以便进行修复。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>工具失效器：</strong> 可在配置文件中指定无法破坏方块、造成伤害等功能的工具。</span></li>\n</ul>",
